# SAVE/RELOAD CHECK, part 2, for bead inc-akac: load the character
# tools/keys/pain-save.keys just saved (PAIN_TALLY leftover = 6 at that
# point) and land one more brawling hit. If PAIN_TALLY survived the save
# and reload, the probe's tally_before on this hit reads 6, not 0. Run
# with INCURSION_LOAD=<the .sav pain-save.keys produced>.
d
@expect "Gender"
@dump:sheet
ESC

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Animals"
@choose "brown bear"
RIGHT RIGHT ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC

s s s
@while "Die?" n

RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:reload-hit

@quit
